#! console --size 140x34
# The Files tree is a VS Code style explorer on the right edge: folders first, indent guides, ↻ ⊟ ✕ in
# its header; a click on a file row opens it in a panel beside the chat.
wait-frame 15000 command palette
key alt-n
wait-frame 10000 untitled
key alt-e
wait-frame 5000 EXPLORER:
snap tree
mouse move 120 4
snap hover
mouse down 120 6
snap folder
mouse down 120 2
wait-frame 5000 ✎ settings.local.json
snap opened
mouse scrolldown 120 10
snap scrolled
mouse down 133 0
snap collapsed
quit
